      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "metadata": {},
      "source": [
        "### 10. Run Full Test Inference & Export\n",
        "This runs:\n",
        "- Test ingestion (France, India, US)\n",
        "- Test indexing\n",
        "- Test candidate generation (all ~1.73M test S1 entities)\n",
        "- Streaming feature extraction + scoring (memory-efficient on-the-fly batches)\n",
        "- Exporting `matching_results.tsv` and `candidate_pairs.tsv`\n",
        "- Built-in disk-backed validation"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "code",
